        <detaileddescription>
<para>Transmit power level in dBm. Values:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Range:</bold> -127 to +20</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold><ref refid="group__sl__bt__connection__tx__power__const_1gae560733d11bda2eada9aa81a810bfa6b" kindref="member">SL_BT_CONNECTION_TX_POWER_UNMANAGED</ref> (0x7E):</bold> Remote device is not managing power levels on this PHY.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold><ref refid="group__sl__bt__connection__tx__power__const_1gac9f8c677a74eeba96ff3314126676696" kindref="member">SL_BT_CONNECTION_TX_POWER_UNAVAILABLE</ref> (0x7F):</bold> Transmit power level is not available. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
