        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enum <ref refid="group__sl__bt__connection_1ga817c9d6f24d206939cbd02f82c1313a7" kindref="member">sl_bt_connection_tx_power_flag_t</ref>. Transmit power level flags. Ignore this field if <computeroutput>power_level</computeroutput> is set to 0x7E or 0x7F. Values:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_connection_tx_power_flag_none (0x0):</bold> No flag is defined for the reported TX power level</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_connection_tx_power_at_minimum (0x1):</bold> Transmit power level is at minimum level.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_connection_tx_power_at_maximum (0x2):</bold> Transmit power level is at maximum level. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
